            "Auto prefers Edited,",
            "File, then Trans.",
            "",
            "Up to 64 slices.",
            "PRER: 0-30 ms.",
            "New Trans: 3 ms.",
            "File/Equal: 0 ms.",
            "PRER keeps cut ends",
            "and onsets in place.",
            "",
            "Held notes keep cuts.",
            "Audition follows edits",
