        {
          "title": "FX choices",
          "lines": [
            "Each corner can use",
            "any of seventeen FX.",
            "Duplicate choices",
            "have separate",
            "settings and tails.",
            "",
            "Dry, Filter, Blur,",
            "Delay, Delay Field,",
            "Spectral Spray,",
            "Fracture, Shred,",
            "Buffer, Reverb, Tape,",
            "Pitch/Detune, Rotary,",
            "Rerun, Shutter,",
            "Tumble and Spool.",
            "",
            "Knob 1 chooses FX.",
            "Knobs 2-5 change",
            "its sound. Knobs 6-8",
            "set pressure target,",
            "amount and level.",
            "",
            "Fracture PROC has",
            "ten processors.",
            "Shred CIRC has eight",
            "drive circuits.",
            "",
            "Spray HOLD at FRZ",
            "freezes its memory.",
            "Capture sound first.",
            "",
            "Reverb TYPE selects",
            "Plate or Room.",
            "Tape has no added",
            "hiss or pops.",
            "",
            "Driven corners can",
            "be loud. Lower LVL",
            "before raising drive.",
            "",
            "Delay DETAIL RANG",
            "extends TIME to 8s.",
            "Delay Field reaches",
            "8s at the last tap.",
            "",
            "Spectral SOFT and",
            "DAMP smooth textures.",
            "TRNS retains attacks.",
            "",
            "Distortion HEAD adds",
            "input headroom.",
            "DYN controls chords;",
            "DAMP softens highs.",
            "",
            "Pitch PITC: +/-24 st.",
            "FINE: +/-100 cents.",
            "WIND: 20-180 ms.",
            "SPRD: stereo cents.",
            "Unison keeps it dry.",
            "",
            "Rotary DETAIL adds",
            "XOVR, BAL, DOPL, TONE.",
            "RATE 0 stops motion.",
            "DEPT 0 keeps it dry.",
            "",
            "Knob 1 groups FX.",
            "Click main on CORNER",
            "for the family picker.",
            "Click family, then FX.",
            "Back returns a level.",
            "",
            "Z TO MACRO changes",
            "several controls.",
            "Use Z CHAR and ZAMT.",
            "",
            "Rhythm SYNC uses BPM.",
            "FREE uses ms or Hz.",
            "SEAM smooths repeats.",
            "SEED fixes choices.",
            "HOLD keeps a capture.",
            "Spool REPT repeats."
